 "notes": ["2024 Jerry Horny"]}, {"t": 6808, "time": "01:53:28", "artist": "unknown", "title": "Angazaifa Dub", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/unknown+Angazaifa+Dub", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=unknown+Angazaifa+Dub&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“this has been Sobin on the decks this is called Angazaifa Dub I hope that's how I pronounce it”"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 5, "low": 6}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:15:06", "end": "00:15:34", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5 Sydney with Tangela."}, {"start": "00:29:59", "end": "00:31:34", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5 this is Tobin DJing taking over Sunset with Tangela just for the night um she'll be back soon I promise but for now you're stuck with me until 8pm so that's another hour and a half playing some beautiful dubby echoey liquidy bass in the same vein as Tangela's own personal style. Text in 0435 123 945 if you have been enjoying what I've been mixing so far. Half an hour into the show, I want to first acknowledge that we are on unceded Gadigal land. FBI Radio is situated at the birthplace of Black Theatre here in Redfern, And in doing so, in witnessing the gentrification that is slowly and horrendously taking over this specific area, I want to acknowledge that we are situated here on Redfern and that and pay respects to my elders, to the traditional elders, past, present and emerging. Always was, always will be Aboriginal land. i'll be mixing in until eight and then narini will be taking over for um the next hour after that at 8 p.m till 9 but for now enjoy text in keep me company"}, {"start": "00:40:15", "end": "00:40:57", "text": "Release your body to the best. Yellow grass and green skies. Nothing less for the beautiful minds. Come to me. Come to me. Come to me. Come to me. Entering your consciousness. Hedonism is what I expect. Feel the sound through your chest. Release your body to the best."}, {"start": "00:46:13", "end": "00:46:34", "text": ""}, {"start": "00:47:18", "end": "00:47:40", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:02:15", "end": "01:02:33", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:05:26", "end": "01:05:45", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5 Sydney with Tangela."}, {"start": "01:22:27", "end": "01:24:05", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5. Whoa, it's been like an hour and a half. I can't even realize. Hello, my name is Harbin. I am the DJ covering Tangela on Sunset tonight. Text in 0435123945. If you've been loving the tunes, question mark. a few people that have been shouting me out which is so sweet shout out to mark shout out to evil eye um shout out to no name shout out to sbt shout out to cedar shout out to cedar i think it's cedar hello and shout out today huge love on the text line so keep me loved up 0435123945 this is sunsets with tangella but it's not tangella it's yvonne honoring the sound of tangella liquidy dubby bassy detailed nuanced specific etc etc all night until 8pm so not really all night but 40 minutes left after me you will be joined by narini who's going to be taking you through all sydney music electronic music for an hour on the bridge keep us company question mark hello goodbye enjoy"}, {"start": "01:57:25", "end": "01:59:17", "text": "FBi Radio 94.5 this has been Sobin on the decks this is called Angazaifa Dub I hope that's how I pronounce it but anyways anyways anyways I digress I digress Naraini is going to be on the decks now and they're going to be playing some Sydney local electronic sounds mixing in for an hour from 8 till 9 p.m. so stay tuned stay with us text in 0435 123 945 if you have any song requests kidding don't do that you can you can text in if you have any songs that you want nareni to play next week if you know you want to put them on to some tracks and then from those requests slash suggestions they will curate the playlist for next week that's how that works yes but we're always on the hunt for new sydney electronic music so text line is a great way to directly access narini direct access to the messaging back what's your phone number let's say it out loud right now i'm so kidding i'm so kidding that's a privacy issue anyways thank you so much for staying with me for the past two hours if you have it's been really fun i haven't dj'd um by myself for two hours i think that was the first time actually um since dance class actually if we were there on the night anyways this has been sobin on the decks and now you've got the bridge with nareini keep them company hashtag goodbye"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "-1:59:44"}, "track": {"title": "Don Junio", "artists": [{"name": "D Juno"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:17"}, "track": {"title": "700 Million Light Years from Earth", "artists": [{"name": "Drexciya"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "Track Ten", "artists": [{"name": "Juan Atkins"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:19:26"}, "track": {"title": "NUEVAYoL", "artists": [{"name": "Bad Bunny"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:36:00"}, "track": {"title": "Congarama (Glenn Gonzalez Remix)", "artists": [{"name": "Anthony Selvaggio & David Pintó"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"